  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1302.50 Water system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1302.50 “Water system” means a “public water system” as defined in RSA 485:1-a, XV or a “privately owned redistribution system” as defined in RSA 485:1-a, XIV-a, both reprinted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. #12903, eff 10-23-19",
